{"candidateAnswer":"Eczema or chronic dermatitis, given the range of environmental triggers she reacts to.","evidence":"[D5:11 | 6:59 pm on 18 March, 2022] Joanna: I wish I wasn't allergic! I would get two turtles today if I could! I found out recently I'm allergic to cockroaches as well, so who knows if I'll ever get a pet.\n[D2:23 | 2:01 pm on 23 January, 2022] Joanna: I'm allergic to most reptiles and animals with fur. It can be a bit of a drag, but I find other ways to be happy.","itemId":"urn:uuid:35f7a0c4-a870-5af4-b3a1-3ef2eb62d83d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b6a2ffa0e186c4c519e3252ed23037867c9d3d3da4aafccd44a980abaacca662","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What underlying condition might Joanna have based on her allergies?","referenceAnswer":"asthma","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b6a2ffa0e186c4c519e3252ed23037867c9d3d3da4aafccd44a980abaacca662"}}]}